{"id":"vol9-07","section":2,"path":"bank/listening/vol9-07/audio-2.m4a","model":"small","duration":428.01,"segments":[{"start":0.0,"end":3.18,"text":"Now turn to section 2 on page 3.","words":[["Now",0.0,0.36],["turn",0.36,0.68],["to",0.68,0.84],["section",0.84,1.08],["2",1.08,1.66],["on",1.66,2.28],["page",2.28,2.56],["3.",2.56,3.18]]},{"start":5.26,"end":11.38,"text":"Part 2. You will hear a talk given at a public library by a member of staff called David Laws.","words":[["Part",5.26,5.44],["2.",5.44,5.84],["You",6.3,6.48],["will",6.48,6.62],["hear",6.62,6.78],["a",6.78,6.92],["talk",6.92,7.18],["given",7.18,7.74],["at",7.74,7.9],["a",7.9,8.02],["public",8.02,8.22],["library",8.22,8.8],["by",8.8,9.06],["a",9.06,9.22],["member",9.22,9.42],["of",9.42,9.6],["staff",9.6,9.94],["called",9.94,10.5],["David",10.5,10.8],["Laws.",10.8,11.38]]},{"start":12.08,"end":15.34,"text":"First, you have some time to look at questions 11 to 15.","words":[["First,",12.08,12.5],["you",12.74,12.86],["have",12.86,13.0],["some",13.0,13.18],["time",13.18,13.44],["to",13.44,13.58],["look",13.58,13.7],["at",13.7,13.86],["questions",13.86,14.22],["11",14.22,14.74],["to",14.74,14.96],["15.",14.96,15.34]]},{"start":35.97,"end":39.43,"text":"Now listen carefully and answer questions 11 to 15.","words":[["Now",35.97,36.31],["listen",36.31,36.61],["carefully",36.61,37.09],["and",37.09,37.53],["answer",37.53,37.81],["questions",37.81,38.23],["11",38.23,38.85],["to",38.85,39.05],["15.",39.05,39.43]]},{"start":40.13,"end":44.51,"text":"Good morning everyone. Welcome to Rosedale Library Open Day.","words":[["Good",40.13,40.63],["morning",40.63,40.91],["everyone.",40.91,41.35],["Welcome",41.99,42.33],["to",42.33,42.65],["Rosedale",42.65,43.23],["Library",43.23,43.71],["Open",43.71,44.15],["Day.",44.15,44.51]]},{"start":44.51,"end":49.57,"text":"day. It's good to see that so many members of the public are interested in the future","words":[["day.",44.51,44.61],["It's",45.23,45.53],["good",45.53,45.67],["to",45.67,45.83],["see",45.83,46.07],["that",46.07,46.27],["so",46.27,46.49],["many",46.49,46.71],["members",46.71,47.05],["of",47.05,47.27],["the",47.27,47.37],["public",47.37,47.67],["are",47.67,48.19],["interested",48.19,48.63],["in",48.63,49.09],["the",49.09,49.23],["future",49.23,49.57]]},{"start":49.57,"end":56.17,"text":"of the library. For those of you who don't know me, my name is David Laws. I'm the new","words":[["of",49.57,49.83],["the",49.83,49.97],["library.",49.97,50.31],["For",51.27,51.53],["those",51.53,51.75],["of",51.75,51.91],["you",51.91,52.07],["who",52.07,52.23],["don't",52.23,52.49],["know",52.49,52.67],["me,",52.67,52.87],["my",53.35,53.53],["name",53.53,53.79],["is",53.79,54.05],["David",54.05,54.39],["Laws.",54.39,55.03],["I'm",55.57,55.83],["the",55.83,55.95],["new",55.95,56.17]]},{"start":56.17,"end":62.41,"text":"personal assistant to Penny Williams, the library director. Penny was supposed to be leading","words":[["personal",56.17,56.63],["assistant",56.63,57.21],["to",57.21,57.67],["Penny",57.67,57.91],["Williams,",57.91,58.41],["the",58.93,59.01],["library",59.01,59.33],["director.",59.33,59.87],["Penny",60.75,61.27],["was",61.27,61.51],["supposed",61.51,61.77],["to",61.77,62.07],["be",62.07,62.17],["leading",62.17,62.41]]},{"start":62.41,"end":67.41,"text":"this meeting, but due to unexpected illness I will be taking her place this morning.","words":[["this",62.41,62.71],["meeting,",62.71,62.99],["but",63.45,63.63],["due",63.63,63.85],["to",63.85,64.01],["unexpected",64.01,64.53],["illness",64.53,65.07],["I",65.07,65.71],["will",65.71,65.85],["be",65.85,66.01],["taking",66.01,66.29],["her",66.29,66.57],["place",66.57,66.87],["this",66.87,67.13],["morning.",67.13,67.41]]},{"start":68.19,"end":72.47,"text":"We felt that this would be better than postponing the meeting to a later date.","words":[["We",68.19,68.51],["felt",68.51,68.79],["that",68.79,68.99],["this",68.99,69.21],["would",69.21,69.39],["be",69.39,69.55],["better",69.55,69.83],["than",69.83,70.07],["postponing",70.07,70.73],["the",70.73,70.95],["meeting",70.95,71.25],["to",71.25,71.73],["a",71.73,71.89],["later",71.89,72.13],["date.",72.13,72.47]]},{"start":73.69,"end":80.63,"text":"Firstly, a couple of small matters. The guest speaker talks this year have been incredibly","words":[["Firstly,",73.69,74.33],["a",74.99,75.23],["couple",75.23,75.45],["of",75.45,75.61],["small",75.61,75.93],["matters.",75.93,76.43],["The",77.33,77.67],["guest",77.67,77.93],["speaker",77.93,78.51],["talks",78.51,78.83],["this",78.83,79.17],["year",79.17,79.45],["have",79.45,79.83],["been",79.83,80.05],["incredibly",80.05,80.63]]},{"start":80.63,"end":87.79,"text":"popular and the slight rise in ticket price has not put anyone off. We will continue to","words":[["popular",80.63,81.31],["and",81.31,82.13],["the",82.13,82.25],["slight",82.25,82.59],["rise",82.59,82.97],["in",82.97,83.23],["ticket",83.23,83.45],["price",83.45,83.93],["has",83.93,84.33],["not",84.33,84.51],["put",84.51,84.77],["anyone",84.77,85.17],["off.",85.17,85.55],["We",86.49,86.89],["will",86.89,87.09],["continue",87.09,87.55],["to",87.55,87.79]]},{"start":87.79,"end":94.53,"text":"hold these events on a monthly basis. It has, however, come to our attention that some people","words":[["hold",87.79,88.11],["these",88.11,88.41],["events",88.41,88.79],["on",88.79,89.31],["a",89.31,89.43],["monthly",89.43,89.67],["basis.",89.67,90.21],["It",91.19,91.43],["has,",91.43,91.73],["however,",91.81,92.07],["come",92.49,92.67],["to",92.67,92.85],["our",92.85,93.01],["attention",93.01,93.37],["that",93.37,93.97],["some",93.97,94.21],["people",94.21,94.53]]},{"start":94.53,"end":100.57,"text":"have missed events because they didn't know they were on. We now intend to notify everyone","words":[["have",94.53,94.77],["missed",94.77,95.03],["events",95.03,95.43],["because",95.43,95.97],["they",95.97,96.21],["didn't",96.21,96.49],["know",96.49,96.71],["they",96.71,96.89],["were",96.89,97.03],["on.",97.03,97.29],["We",98.19,98.73],["now",98.73,98.93],["intend",98.93,99.27],["to",99.27,99.57],["notify",99.57,100.01],["everyone",100.01,100.57]]},{"start":100.57,"end":106.71,"text":"through email reminders. Also, you might be aware that we had a break-in last month","words":[["through",100.57,101.11],["email",101.11,101.57],["reminders.",101.57,102.19],["Also,",103.35,103.71],["you",104.17,104.33],["might",104.33,104.51],["be",104.51,104.71],["aware",104.71,104.99],["that",104.99,105.21],["we",105.21,105.35],["had",105.35,105.51],["a",105.51,105.63],["break",105.63,105.83],["-in",105.83,106.03],["last",106.03,106.29],["month",106.29,106.71]]},{"start":106.71,"end":111.97,"text":"and while the thief or thieves actually left empty-handed, they did smash a","words":[["and",106.71,107.35],["while",107.35,107.61],["the",107.61,107.83],["thief",107.83,108.11],["or",108.11,108.41],["thieves",108.41,108.67],["actually",108.67,109.31],["left",109.31,109.65],["empty",109.65,110.07],["-handed,",110.07,110.45],["they",110.95,111.17],["did",111.17,111.39],["smash",111.39,111.71],["a",111.71,111.97]]},{"start":111.97,"end":117.83,"text":"number of windows and kicked down a door trying to get in. Police believe the","words":[["number",111.97,112.21],["of",112.21,112.41],["windows",112.41,112.81],["and",112.81,113.39],["kicked",113.39,113.63],["down",113.63,113.91],["a",113.91,114.09],["door",114.09,114.35],["trying",114.35,114.87],["to",114.87,115.07],["get",115.07,115.21],["in.",115.21,115.49],["Police",116.59,117.15],["believe",117.15,117.55],["the",117.55,117.83]]},{"start":117.83,"end":121.83,"text":"offenders were just taking a chance that there might be something valuable in","words":[["offenders",117.83,118.19],["were",118.19,118.51],["just",118.51,118.77],["taking",118.77,119.11],["a",119.11,119.29],["chance",119.29,119.65],["that",119.65,120.19],["there",120.19,120.33],["might",120.33,120.51],["be",120.51,120.73],["something",120.73,120.95],["valuable",120.95,121.47],["in",121.47,121.83]]},{"start":121.83,"end":127.01,"text":"the library. Anyway, we hope that the new security cameras along Roberts","words":[["the",121.83,121.93],["library.",121.93,122.31],["Anyway,",123.33,123.71],["we",124.29,124.49],["hope",124.49,124.77],["that",124.77,124.97],["the",124.97,125.09],["new",125.09,125.27],["security",125.27,125.69],["cameras",125.69,126.27],["along",126.27,126.61],["Roberts",126.61,127.01]]},{"start":127.01,"end":133.17,"text":"Avenue might deter this kind of activity. Now, the purpose of the meeting, of course,","words":[["Avenue",127.01,127.45],["might",127.45,128.09],["deter",128.09,128.51],["this",128.51,128.87],["kind",128.87,129.17],["of",129.17,129.29],["activity.",129.29,129.73],["Now,",130.89,131.19],["the",131.67,131.81],["purpose",131.81,132.13],["of",132.13,132.35],["the",132.35,132.45],["meeting,",132.45,132.69],["of",132.83,132.93],["course,",132.93,133.17]]},{"start":133.63,"end":136.71,"text":"is to present the proposals for a new library layout.","words":[["is",133.63,133.81],["to",133.81,133.93],["present",133.93,134.27],["the",134.27,134.49],["proposals",134.49,134.95],["for",134.95,135.43],["a",135.43,135.59],["new",135.59,135.81],["library",135.81,136.25],["layout.",136.25,136.71]]},{"start":137.99,"end":143.97,"text":"Rosedale Library has been serving the public for 50 years, but it's not been extended since","words":[["Rosedale",137.99,138.63],["Library",138.63,139.07],["has",139.07,139.57],["been",139.57,139.75],["serving",139.75,140.11],["the",140.11,140.33],["public",140.33,140.61],["for",140.61,140.87],["50",140.87,141.21],["years,",141.21,141.73],["but",142.11,142.35],["it's",142.35,142.55],["not",142.55,142.67],["been",142.67,142.87],["extended",142.87,143.41],["since",143.41,143.97]]},{"start":143.97,"end":150.71,"text":"the renovations in 1969. Since opening, the number of books on our shelves and other items","words":[["the",143.97,144.19],["renovations",144.19,144.79],["in",144.79,145.11],["1969.",145.11,145.95],["Since",147.13,147.49],["opening,",147.49,147.87],["the",148.23,148.27],["number",148.27,148.51],["of",148.51,148.67],["books",148.67,148.91],["on",148.91,149.17],["our",149.17,149.33],["shelves",149.33,149.73],["and",149.73,150.01],["other",150.01,150.25],["items",150.25,150.71]]},{"start":150.71,"end":156.53,"text":"has more than doubled and visitor numbers have increased 20% in the last ten years.","words":[["has",150.71,151.15],["more",151.15,151.43],["than",151.43,151.63],["doubled",151.63,151.97],["and",151.97,152.81],["visitor",152.81,153.15],["numbers",153.15,153.53],["have",153.53,153.81],["increased",153.81,154.21],["20",154.21,154.77],["%",154.77,155.15],["in",155.15,155.47],["the",155.47,155.57],["last",155.57,155.85],["ten",155.85,156.11],["years.",156.11,156.53]]},{"start":157.41,"end":160.19,"text":"There is therefore a clear need for an extension.","words":[["There",157.41,157.75],["is",157.75,157.95],["therefore",157.95,158.35],["a",158.35,158.59],["clear",158.59,158.87],["need",158.87,159.31],["for",159.31,159.59],["an",159.59,159.73],["extension.",159.73,160.19]]},{"start":161.21,"end":166.45,"text":"We hope that you have noticed some recent improvements to the library such as the eight","words":[["We",161.21,161.69],["hope",161.69,161.95],["that",161.95,162.17],["you",162.17,162.33],["have",162.33,162.51],["noticed",162.51,162.91],["some",162.91,163.23],["recent",163.23,163.59],["improvements",163.59,164.21],["to",164.21,164.57],["the",164.57,164.71],["library",164.71,165.09],["such",165.09,165.79],["as",165.79,165.99],["the",165.99,166.13],["eight",166.13,166.45]]},{"start":166.45,"end":169.13,"text":"new PCs that were installed back in June.","words":[["new",166.45,166.77],["PCs",166.77,167.23],["that",167.23,167.65],["were",167.65,167.79],["installed",167.79,168.29],["back",168.29,168.63],["in",168.63,168.87],["June.",168.87,169.13]]},{"start":170.11,"end":175.27,"text":"We're also aware that the lighting is quite poor but you'll shortly see a big difference","words":[["We're",170.11,170.53],["also",170.53,170.81],["aware",170.81,171.21],["that",171.21,171.47],["the",171.47,171.57],["lighting",171.57,171.87],["is",171.87,172.15],["quite",172.15,172.39],["poor",172.39,172.83],["but",172.83,173.55],["you'll",173.55,173.85],["shortly",173.85,174.19],["see",174.19,174.53],["a",174.53,174.67],["big",174.67,174.81],["difference",174.81,175.27]]},{"start":175.27,"end":180.93,"text":"because the City Council continued to support us and have authorised the spending in this area.","words":[["because",175.27,175.79],["the",175.79,176.07],["City",176.07,176.27],["Council",176.27,176.71],["continued",176.71,177.45],["to",177.45,177.77],["support",177.77,178.11],["us",178.11,178.43],["and",178.43,178.79],["have",178.79,178.93],["authorised",178.93,179.53],["the",179.53,179.69],["spending",179.69,180.07],["in",180.07,180.37],["this",180.37,180.55],["area.",180.55,180.93]]},{"start":182.03,"end":189.45,"text":"We've also applied to the Council to approve the addition of another member of staff to work part-time in the afternoons,","words":[["We've",182.03,182.63],["also",182.63,182.93],["applied",182.93,183.33],["to",183.33,183.53],["the",183.53,183.65],["Council",183.65,184.05],["to",184.05,184.55],["approve",184.55,184.95],["the",184.95,185.15],["addition",185.15,185.51],["of",185.51,185.71],["another",185.71,185.99],["member",185.99,186.25],["of",186.25,186.47],["staff",186.47,186.81],["to",186.81,187.37],["work",187.37,187.61],["part",187.61,187.93],["-time",187.93,188.33],["in",188.33,188.53],["the",188.53,188.65],["afternoons,",188.65,189.45]]},{"start":189.63,"end":193.35,"text":"when mothers and children tend to use the library more often.","words":[["when",189.63,190.07],["mothers",190.07,190.35],["and",190.35,190.61],["children",190.61,191.03],["tend",191.03,191.55],["to",191.55,191.75],["use",191.75,192.03],["the",192.03,192.21],["library",192.21,192.59],["more",192.59,192.91],["often.",192.91,193.35]]},{"start":193.93,"end":197.21,"text":"And this decision will be made in the next few weeks.","words":[["And",193.93,194.27],["this",194.27,194.47],["decision",194.47,194.91],["will",194.91,195.39],["be",195.39,195.55],["made",195.55,195.87],["in",195.87,196.09],["the",196.09,196.21],["next",196.21,196.47],["few",196.47,196.79],["weeks.",196.79,197.21]]},{"start":197.89,"end":203.17,"text":"Before you hear the rest of the talk, you have some time to look at questions 16 to 20.","words":[["Before",197.89,198.33],["you",198.33,198.57],["hear",198.57,198.75],["the",198.75,198.91],["rest",198.91,199.09],["of",199.09,199.23],["the",199.23,199.33],["talk,",199.33,199.63],["you",200.07,200.23],["have",200.23,200.39],["some",200.39,200.57],["time",200.57,200.87],["to",200.87,201.05],["look",201.05,201.19],["at",201.19,201.33],["questions",201.33,201.73],["16",201.73,202.57],["to",202.57,202.81],["20.",202.81,203.17]]},{"start":226.21,"end":232.37,"text":"Now, turning to the proposal for the extensions and alterations to the library, please see","words":[["Now,",226.21,226.93],["turning",227.13,227.63],["to",227.63,227.89],["the",227.89,228.01],["proposal",228.01,228.39],["for",228.39,228.75],["the",228.75,228.89],["extensions",228.89,229.37],["and",229.37,229.73],["alterations",229.73,230.41],["to",230.41,230.67],["the",230.67,230.81],["library,",230.81,231.15],["please",231.71,232.01],["see",232.01,232.37]]},{"start":232.37,"end":234.01,"text":"the second page of your handout.","words":[["the",232.37,232.53],["second",232.53,232.81],["page",232.81,233.23],["of",233.23,233.41],["your",233.41,233.57],["handout.",233.57,234.01]]},{"start":234.93,"end":240.59,"text":"The double line indicates the rooms in the existing building and the dotted lines show","words":[["The",234.93,235.23],["double",235.23,235.47],["line",235.47,235.85],["indicates",235.85,236.29],["the",236.29,236.73],["rooms",236.73,237.07],["in",237.07,237.33],["the",237.33,237.45],["existing",237.45,237.89],[